# hypothesis caches the inputs that broke a property test. Unlike .pytest_cache
# it does not write its own .gitignore, and its contents are DERIVED FROM
# WHATEVER THE STRATEGIES WERE FED - so on a machine holding real captures it
# must not become committable. The PII gate scans tracked files; this keeps the
# database from ever being one.
.hypothesis/
